OL,3,GNEWSAHow you can get council's #250
OL,4,Acost of living help
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey must also prove they are
OL,7,Fstruggling to pay for essential items
OL,8,Ffor themselves or their dependants by
OL,9,Fsubmitting full bank statements for
OL,10,FAugust, September and October.
